{"unit_id":"aokamoaki__dsh-notify#card-zh","repo":"aokamoaki/dsh-notify","commit":"87272389a90141649c91d2d6da0b3d241974fa59","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notify 是面向 DSH web 客户端的 Windows 通知插件：在对话回合结束、出错、目标完成或 agent 等待用户操作时，通过 Windows toast 和提示音提醒。它在会话标题栏提供铃铛，可切换通知并调节音量；完成类提醒在页面或桌面窗口处于前台时静默，提问和审批提醒仍会触发。配置保存在本机 dsh-notify.json，适合运行长任务并切换到其他窗口的用户。需要 Windows 通知与 PowerShell。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:266-353","lib/client.js:36-127","lib/notify.ps1:45-66"]}
{"unit_id":"aokamoaki__dsh-notify#card-en","repo":"aokamoaki/dsh-notify","commit":"87272389a90141649c91d2d6da0b3d241974fa59","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-notify alerts Windows DSH users when turns finish, errors occur, goals complete, or the agent needs input. The conversation-header bell toggles alerts and volume. Completion alerts pause while DSH is foreground; questions and approvals still alert. Settings stay local. Requires PowerShell.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:266-353","lib/client.js:36-127","lib/notify.ps1:45-66"]}
